      },
      "text": "BUDGET POLICY & PROCESS",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.5753274397051424,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": false,
      "depends_on": [],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:3",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 251.64,
        "y0": 203.734,
        "x1": 362.8029,
        "y1": 220.8
      },
      "text": "Effective date: 09/15/2011 Adopted: 09/14/2011",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9983013961142403,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:4",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 241.338,
        "x1": 373.0558,
        "y1": 247.98
      },
      "text": "Applicability: Town, School, and Enterprise Departments",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.7552738756983686,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": false,
      "depends_on": [],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:5",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 268.6132,
        "x1": 173.0494,
        "y1": 274.74
      },
      "text": "I. Purpose",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9994356516675369,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:6",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 293.4489,
        "x1": 522.9891,
        "y1": 322.0199
      },
      "text": "The overall goal implementing financial policies is to improve fiscal planning and maintain effective management of the Town\u2019s financial resources. One of the key deliverables in obtaining the goal is to provide a balanced budget without the assistance of one time revenue streams.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999898700241703,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:7",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 339.4687,
        "x1": 495.597,
        "y1": 345.0598
      },
      "text": "The purpose of this process is to:",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9968288102503438,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:9",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 362.4485,
        "x1": 506.8673,
        "y1": 379.5597
      },
      "text": "1. Ensure annual budgets for all Town, School, and Enterprise Funds are structurally balanced throughout the budget process;",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999039009968564,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:10",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 362.4485,
        "x1": 175.7021,
        "y1": 368.0397
      },
      "text": "1. Ensure",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.999802813275222,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:11",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 385.4284,
        "x1": 504.2575,
        "y1": 402.5396
      },
      "text": "2. Ensure recurring revenues will equal or exceed recurring expenditures in both the projected and adopted budget;",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999646441299975,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:12",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 385.4284,
        "x1": 175.7201,
        "y1": 391.0196
      },
      "text": "2. Ensure",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9998982763602631,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:13",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 408.4083,
        "x1": 470.303,
        "y1": 425.5194
      },
      "text": "3. Ensure that if a structural imbalance occurs, a plan will be developed and implemented to provide for a balanced budget.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999646440382064,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:14",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 408.4083,
        "x1": 175.7151,
        "y1": 413.9994
      },
      "text": "3. Ensure",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9968364656787913,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:15",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 443.3932,
        "x1": 324.0233,
        "y1": 449.52
      },
      "text": "II. Budgetary Policy \u2013 Operating Budget",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9996634933103352,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:5"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:16",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 89.999,
        "y0": 468.2289,
        "x1": 509.2167,
        "y1": 519.8398
      },
      "text": "All funds are required to balance. As such, total projected revenues and other resources must equal of sum of budgetary expenditures for each fund. Revenues and other resources are derived from the following: current revenue charges; increases in existing revenue charges; new revenue sources; and unallocated reserves carried forward from prior years to the extent allowed by law.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999869928952294,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:17",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 89.999,
        "y0": 537.2285,
        "x1": 521.3463,
        "y1": 588.8395
      },
      "text": "Beginning in FY2014, all requests for appropriations are considered only in conjunction with measurable performance criteria. Expenditures are approved or rejected on the basis of planned levels of performance. Therefore, it is necessary for each activity within a fund to prepare a performance plan consisting of workload measures, efficiency measures, and effectiveness measures.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999957771680446,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:18",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 89.999,
        "y0": 606.2282,
        "x1": 516.8701,
        "y1": 669.2991
      },
      "text": "Expenditure budgets for enterprise operations (i.e., Water, Sewer, Airport, Solid Waste, and Our Island Home) must be funded either exclusively or primarily by user fee revenues; unless the Town decides to use the general tax revenue when a greater public benefit is demonstrated (i.e. Solid Waste and Our Island Home). In addition, expenditure budgets for enterprise operations that require the use of general tax revenue as a funding source to balance the operating budget require Board of Selectmen approval prior to forwarding to the Finance Committee.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999785552373449,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:19",
      "locator": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 89.999,
        "y0": 686.6878,
        "x1": 509.6956,
        "y1": 715.319
      },
      "text": "Allocations from the General Fund are based on a long-range financial plan which includes an unallocated fund reserve. This reserve protects the Town against catastrophic revenue losses and major emergency expenditures as well as contributes to the Town\u2019s favorable bond rating.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9998766084745864,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:0",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 48.6488,
        "x1": 218.4162,
        "y1": 54.24
      },
      "text": "IX. Timeline",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.8903608537682925,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": false,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:20",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 89.9996,
        "y0": 48.6488,
        "x1": 520.215,
        "y1": 65.76
      },
      "text": "Ongoing expenses are never funded by a non-recurring or one-time revenue source. Future and current funding sources are identified for all new programs and services.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.99994170883497,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:15"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:21",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 84.7731,
        "x1": 340.5888,
        "y1": 90.8999
      },
      "text": "III. Budgetary Policy \u2013 Capital Expenditures",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9988288135804465,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:0"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:22",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 109.6088,
        "x1": 495.2206,
        "y1": 149.7
      },
      "text": "A five year program for infrastructure capital improvements is updated annually through the budget process. The plan identifies not only anticipated capital expenditures in excess of $50,000 but also related operating expenses and anticipated funding sources. Capital improvements less than $50,000 are funded within the operating budget.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999832985803582,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:23",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 167.0887,
        "x1": 519.0596,
        "y1": 195.6598
      },
      "text": "Capital projects in excess of $50,000 financed through the issuance of bonds will be financed for a period not to exceed the useful \u201clife\u201d of the project as defined by Massachusetts General Law (M.G.L.)",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999921107415493,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:24",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 213.1087,
        "x1": 510.6995,
        "y1": 241.6797
      },
      "text": "The Town will coordinate the development of the capital budget with the development of the operating budget. Future operating costs associated with new capital projects will be identified and included in operating budget forecasts.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999957771670753,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:25",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 259.0685,
        "x1": 522.4001,
        "y1": 276.1797
      },
      "text": "In accordance with the Town By-law, the Town will contribute up to 1% of prior year local receipts towards capital improvements.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999921107415756,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:26",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 293.5684,
        "x1": 490.7682,
        "y1": 310.6795
      },
      "text": "The Town will preserve its assets at a level adequate to protect the capital investment and minimize future maintenance and replacement costs.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999910603071177,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:27",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 328.0682,
        "x1": 497.466,
        "y1": 345.1794
      },
      "text": "The Town will establish an appropriate distribution of bonded debt and cash financing in the funding of capital projects.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999832985963042,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:28",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 364.1931,
        "x1": 277.03,
        "y1": 370.3199
      },
      "text": "IV. Budgetary Policy \u2013 Revenue",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9998765726402371,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:21"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:29",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 389.0288,
        "x1": 514.4922,
        "y1": 429.1198
      },
      "text": "The Town will establish and maintain a broad revenue base. This is achieved through establishing and maintaining diversified revenue sources in order to distribute the revenue responsibly and equitably and protect the Town from short-term fluctuations in any one revenue source.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999339481146826,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:30",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 446.5085,
        "x1": 524.1193,
        "y1": 463.6197
      },
      "text": "In order to fulfill funding requirements without an over dependence upon property taxes, the Town will attempt to enlarge the revenue base by seeking new revenue sources.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999852610258523,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:31",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 481.0084,
        "x1": 518.6046,
        "y1": 521.0994
      },
      "text": "The Town will implement user fees in all areas where feasible and productive as well as set fees at levels related to the costs of providing the services, within the constraints of the General Laws of Massachusetts. User fees will be reviewed annually as part of the budget process and if applicable, be adjusted to maintain current levels of service.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.99997569977577,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:32",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 538.488,
        "x1": 524.1264,
        "y1": 578.5791
      },
      "text": "In accordance with MGL Chapter 44 Section 53 F 1/2, the Town will establish self-supporting enterprise funds where the relationship between operating costs and revenues is clearly identified or for the purpose to clearly identify the total service costs which may include a subsidy from the General Fund or other funds.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999852610306499,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:33",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 596.0279,
        "x1": 512.4485,
        "y1": 613.079
      },
      "text": "The Town will limit the designation of General Fund revenues for specified purposes in order to maximize flexibility in budgeting and utilize revenues more efficiently.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999852610300181,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:34",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 631.6687,
        "x1": 496.3182,
        "y1": 648.7198
      },
      "text": "The Town will maintain effective collection systems and implement aggressive enforcement strategies in order to maximize revenues from available sources.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999869928866948,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:35",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 666.1686,
        "x1": 514.6639,
        "y1": 694.7396
      },
      "text": "Revenues will be projected conservatively with the goal of avoiding revenue deficits that impact future budgets and of realizing actual revenues at the fund level that equal or exceed budgeted revenues.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
