    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:36",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 713.7527,
        "x1": 289.2309,
        "y1": 719.8795
      },
      "text": "V. Budget Process \u2013 Preparation",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9997037091096352,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:28"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:37",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 45.6442,
        "x1": 522.3661,
        "y1": 65.76
      },
      "text": "The Town & County of Nantucket\u2019s fiscal year begins July 1st and concludes on June 30 th. Major steps in the budgeting process include but are not limited to the following:",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9995694628874031,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:39",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 71.6287,
        "x1": 517.4762,
        "y1": 123.2399
      },
      "text": "a. The Finance Department prepares the five year forecast and assumptions which identify positive and negative financial trends impacting the Town and County. The information is presented to Town Administration as well as the Board of Selectmen. Once adopted by the Board of Selectmen, the forecast and assumptions are then used as the financial framework for budget preparation.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999599366314513,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:40",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 71.6287,
        "x1": 134.3586,
        "y1": 77.2199
      },
      "text": "a.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999987903515407,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:41",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 129.1687,
        "x1": 520.7601,
        "y1": 157.7398
      },
      "text": "b. A Five Year Capital Plan is prepared by the Chief Procurement Officer and presented to Town Administration and the Board of Selectmen. Any additional operating costs associated with the first year of the plan are incorporated into the budget forecast.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999687983124329,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:42",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 129.1687,
        "x1": 134.3546,
        "y1": 134.7599
      },
      "text": "b.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999980057913067,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:43",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 163.6687,
        "x1": 524.281,
        "y1": 226.7397
      },
      "text": "c. The Ad Hoc Budget workgroup will begin meeting in the fall to facilitate communications among the Board of Selectmen, School Committee, and Finance Committee concerning budget issues. The workgroup is comprised of the Chairs and Vice-chairs of the Board of Selectmen, School Committee, and Finance Committee. The Town Manager, Superintendent of Schools, and Finance Director also serve as ex officio members of the workgroup.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999869929646661,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:44",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 163.6687,
        "x1": 133.7955,
        "y1": 169.2598
      },
      "text": "c.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999962747768414,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:45",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 232.6084,
        "x1": 518.0964,
        "y1": 318.7194
      },
      "text": "d. The Finance Department and School Business Office, with directions and guidelines from Town Administration and the Superintendent develop base budget expenditure levels for all departments and town-wide revenue projections for the upcoming fiscal year. Departments prepare data on performance measures and service levels for inclusion in the budget document. Additionally, departments submit service change request to enhance a current activity, establish and activity and/or obtain equipment associated with an activity. These detailed requests are reviewed and changes made to present a balance budget to Town Administration and the Superintendent.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999757000161671,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:46",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 232.6084,
        "x1": 134.3577,
        "y1": 238.1996
      },
      "text": "d.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.999995778984769,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:47",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 324.6482,
        "x1": 512.4444,
        "y1": 387.7191
      },
      "text": "e. Town Administration and the Superintendent conduct budget workshops with their respective Department Heads to review expenditures for the upcoming year and announce any significant changes which directly impact new / existing programs or service levels. The changes are then used to prepare the Town Manager\u2019s budget recommendations to the Board of Selectmen and Superintendent\u2019s budget recommendations to the School Committee.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999687983282538,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:48",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 125.9999,
        "y0": 324.6482,
        "x1": 134.3576,
        "y1": 330.2393
      },
      "text": "e.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999967120090413,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:49",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 393.6479,
        "x1": 506.364,
        "y1": 445.1988
      },
      "text": "f. The Board of Selectmen, School Committee, and Finance Committee conduct a series of workshops and public hearings before making changes to the Town Manager\u2019s and Superintendents budget recommendations. After careful and thorough consideration, the Board of Selectmen; School Committee; and Finance Committee present the budget recommendations to Town Meeting.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999038992144547,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:50",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 393.6479,
        "x1": 131.5691,
        "y1": 399.239
      },
      "text": "f.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999969116795392,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:51",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 451.1276,
        "x1": 519.2405,
        "y1": 468.18
      },
      "text": "g. When the budget is adopted at Town Meeting, the budget becomes effective on July 1 st.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999151943779404,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:52",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 126.0,
        "y0": 451.1276,
        "x1": 134.3577,
        "y1": 456.7188
      },
      "text": "g.",
      "type": "Lbl",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 3,
      "score": 0.9999892219485709,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:54h",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 486.1131,
        "x1": 517.8483,
        "y1": 499.1131
      },
      "text": "VI. Budget Process \u2013 Execution",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9997965291540447,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:55",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 486.1131,
        "x1": 103.4461,
        "y1": 492.2399
      },
      "text": "VI.",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9091940628157076,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": false,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:36"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:54",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 499.1131,
        "x1": 517.8483,
        "y1": 572.8196
      },
      "text": "On July 1 st of each year, the adopted budget is implemented. Concurrently, an analysis of the previous year\u2019s actual expenditures will begin. During this analysis, problem areas are identified and reconciled. Problem areas that have an impact on the current year are closely monitored. Moreover, throughout the year, expenditures, revenues, and performance data are monitored in order to ensure the successful implementation of the Town & County\u2019s service plan. Status reports are provided to Town Administration and the Board of Selectmen on a monthly basis.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999687982367881,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:55"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:56",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 506.7441,
        "x1": 517.8483,
        "y1": 572.8196
      },
      "text": "On July 1 st of each year, the adopted budget is implemented. Concurrently, an analysis of the previous year\u2019s actual expenditures will begin. During this analysis, problem areas are identified and reconciled. Problem areas that have an impact on the current year are closely monitored. Moreover, throughout the year, expenditures, revenues, and performance data are monitored in order to ensure the successful implementation of the Town & County\u2019s service plan. Status reports are provided to Town Administration and the Board of Selectmen on a monthly basis.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999852610368667,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:55"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:57h",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 591.8931,
        "x1": 517.4393,
        "y1": 604.8931
      },
      "text": "VII. Budget Process \u2013 Amendments",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9980561373014705,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:55"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:58",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 591.8931,
        "x1": 106.5073,
        "y1": 598.02
      },
      "text": "VII.",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9987312000053059,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:55"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:57",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 604.8931,
        "x1": 517.4393,
        "y1": 655.6196
      },
      "text": "As conditions change or circumstances are altered, Department Heads are required to notify the Finance Department of anticipated requests for budget amendments. Budget amendments are subject to positive approval at the Annual Town Meeting and/or if applicable, a Special Town Meeting. Once approved, the Finance Department will post the budget amendments within a timely manner.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999038981796932,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:58"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:59h",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 89.9997,
        "y0": 674.693,
        "x1": 514.0391,
        "y1": 687.693
      },
      "text": "VIII. Budgetary Process \u2013 Year End Transfers",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9932701307711402,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": false,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:58"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:60",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 674.693,
        "x1": 109.5642,
        "y1": 680.8198
      },
      "text": "VIII.",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.9966699517381691,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:58"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:59",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "x0": 89.9997,
        "y0": 687.693,
        "x1": 514.0391,
        "y1": 738.4198
      },
      "text": "In accordance with MGL Chapter 44 Section 33B, the Finance Department prepares and presents a request to the Board of Selectmen and Finance Committee for budgetary transfers during the time period or May 1 st to July 15 th. Transfer requests are limited to 3% of the original budget amount of $5,000 whichever is greater. Year end transfers are only used to offset projected deficits in departmental or enterprise fund budgets.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9999151894665772,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:60"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": false
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:61",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 61.7931,
        "x1": 173.7093,
        "y1": 67.9199
      },
      "text": "IX. Timeline",
      "type": "H",
      "level": 1,
      "rule": 1,
      "score": 0.998031591881452,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:60"
      ],
      "in_table_box": false,
      "asked": true
    },
    {
      "card_id": "c3-0094:62",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "x0": 90.0,
        "y0": 86.5688,
        "x1": 504.6985,
        "y1": 103.68
      },
      "text": "The effectiveness of the process will be reviewed at the end of each budget cycle and refined accordingly.",
      "type": "P",
      "level": null,
      "rule": 4,
      "score": 0.9998601795865614,
      "decided_by": "model",
      "proposed": true,
      "depends_on": [
        "c3-0094:61"
      ],
